Error [E0987]: No loop labeled `missing` is in scope
  --> tests/ui/loop_label_not_in_scope.jet:3:9
    |
  3 |         break(missing)
    |         ^^^^^
 Why: A named `break`/`next` must name an enclosing `name :: loop` (D-LOOPLABEL3)
 Fix: Use a label in scope: `break(outer)` or `next(outer)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0987
